{"version":1,"key":"card:416","content":{"id":416,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"456cdc84-9e9a-4c99-9f14-28339b2f960b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑一个列表场景，包含多个垂直排列的子项，每个子项之间需要隔开一定的间隔，一般的写法是为每个子项设置外边距，如"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"9c19b318-7b79-405d-a98e-851bf5119954","collabId":"9dd8a84c-a7d7-478b-9a3d-9f2dfe85f576","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  \n}\n\n.item {\n  /* 上下保证 20px 的间距 */\n  margin: 20px 0;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"11f6f885-1073-4a04-9bd2-a7f48484fbe4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是第一个和最后一个和容器是没有间隔的，为了做到这一点，需要对第一个和最后一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"item"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行特殊处理"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"65e65709-71d6-4e9b-8925-f94acc8513cf","collabId":"9f21d0bc-a1e0-41d8-b345-0ab3faea5a2d","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  \n}\n\n.item {\n  margin: 20px 0;\n}\n.item:first-child, .item:last-child {\n  margin: 0;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8a314968-a18c-4c2a-9f6e-4977f031c58c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样写非常的麻烦，CSS 属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"margin-trim"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以实现上述效果而不用这么麻烦，它的取值语法如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"47accbac-646a-455d-883d-6cb88f9ea611","collabId":"350c050e-6947-4813-8a42-6f6d3373cd4a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"margin-trim = \n  none                                                |\n  block                                               |\n  inline                                              |\n  [ block-start || inline-start || block-end || inline-end ]"},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"3233bdf2-b491-45a5-8d10-fa6cfd236f37","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7dc05dda-5251-41cd-8194-c087f3fed017","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"550bd5af-9f81-4156-998b-d978f3785ebb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"block"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：块级子元素与容器的外边距会被裁剪为 0"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"00e1e3d4-ec00-4706-9549-55d4a9969c4f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"54ae63f9-ef91-408a-9eb1-dfc94f863be2","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inline"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：内联子元素与容器的外边距会被裁剪为 0"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5aa923a4-ad37-486e-85f7-42145af39fea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"默认值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"none"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d7261e28-da3d-46a7-a618-be57ce32afa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来具体指定某一个方向，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"block"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相当于同时设置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"block-start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"block-end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inline"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相当于同时设置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inline-start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inline-end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"信息","collabId":"6a54d353-fb0d-4706-941d-d6a52d117f6f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"80e98c11-2332-4a96-8bf4-e0c4827b6710","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之所使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"left/top"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"right/bottom"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，是考虑到有一些国家它们的阅读方向是从右向左，使用逻辑上的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 比较合理，对于我们来说，可以把 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 骄看作是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"left/top"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 看作是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"right/bottom"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4caaacc1-1f66-4b9c-91c5-c83cb6fd26bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于上面的案例，可以修改如下写法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"a99f560d-f621-4e92-baa6-3a9a50ed6ba4","collabId":"d8b9d555-5ab3-477b-819f-3eb577d461cb","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  /* 块级子元素与父容器的外边距裁剪为 0 */\n  margin-trim: block;\n}\n\n.item {\n  margin: 20px 0;\n}"},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","collabId":"cd7549dd-b00b-4ee0-92fd-058908a2ee5b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bd8fc025-c964-4029-abd8-7bac1117fcbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当然，对于上述场景有更简单的解法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"1c273a13-a2fc-4f28-ae2d-f0216fdeda84","collabId":"78712038-85d4-4f80-86e5-6344f368b809","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1bc03593-4012-40a9-9716-5a7091de707c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是提出了新的解决方案也是极好的，有可能在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"flex"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 布局存在限制的情况了使用此布局，甚至可以结合 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"flex"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 布局更轻松的实现目的。"}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","collabId":"e7f2c768-ce2e-45de-93e2-14f345b2ff61","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b6c92aaf-002b-4634-b6d0-68727db65e7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"margin-trim"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 目前只有 Safari 支持，想要在生产环境使用上这个特性可能还需要等上几年。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_894cb2b6-143e-49d4-a75d-459a14400c68.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_894cb2b6-143e-49d4-a75d-459a14400c68.png","collabId":"6e98dd4e-3910-49bd-bfba-4ee587f7dd08","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e37662b8-4cd3-4452-bda7-0aa74cbf4fcc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"ba806a40-928f-4c39-8f32-d068aca33916","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"652faec2-265f-4fd6-a045-d5aa1000a683","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3edc15b1-f6e2-40fe-bb7e-65468d002c74","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/margin-trim","openEdit":false,"collabId":"2ad27cf0-69d6-4c13-8b1a-be070a19db60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-trim"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6da974dc-5a5b-4909-8254-031e24d7bf32","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a6730996-b9d5-42c1-9b20-904cba1801d9","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/7348643498117922835","openEdit":false,"collabId":"a7a095d9-35ad-4ae5-9d0d-58d5aa326bab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新的 CSS 属性 margin-trim"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["CSS/margin-trim"],"createTime":1711367411024,"updateTime":1791474923031,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923031}}